# Level 7 — Understanding Tool Calls

A tool-enabled model doesn't necessarily execute your Python function automatically.

It may return a **tool call request**.

For example, conceptually:

```python
AIMessage(
    content="",
    tool_calls=[
        {
            "name": "multiply_numbers",
            "args": {
                "a": 20,
                "b": 5
            }
        }
    ]
)
```

The model is saying:

```text
I want to call:

multiply_numbers(20, 5)
```

Your application then executes it.

This distinction is extremely important.

