# Level 8 — Manually Execute the Tool

You can create a tool registry.

```python
tools = [
    add_numbers,
    multiply_numbers
]

tool_map = {
    tool.name: tool
    for tool in tools
}
```

Then:

```python
for tool_call in response.tool_calls:

    tool_name = tool_call["name"]

    tool_args = tool_call["args"]

    selected_tool = tool_map[tool_name]

    result = selected_tool.invoke(tool_args)

    print(result)
```

This gives you the basic architecture of a tool-calling system.

