# Level 9 — Tool Calling Loop

A real agent usually needs a loop.

```text
User
 ↓
LLM
 ↓
Does it need a tool?
 ├── No → Final Answer
 │
 └── Yes
      ↓
   Tool Call
      ↓
   Execute Tool
      ↓
   Tool Result
      ↓
   LLM
      ↓
   Does it need another tool?
      ↓
     ...
      ↓
   Final Answer
```

This is the foundation of an **AI Agent**.

